  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a 'Quantum Portfolio Rebalancing Algorithm' (QPRA) combining QAOA-inspired optimization and AI sentiment analysis and reports backtest performance of 175% cumulative return and a Sharpe ratio of 1.45 over 2013–2023 versus 85% (Sharpe 0.92) for MPT and 110% (Sharpe 1.08) for Black‑Litterman. However, the study explicitly states that no quantum hardware or simulator was used and that the optimization was implemented with classical SciPy routines approximating QAOA behavior.",
